UComments: "the font you use to message your friends on PSLE Results Day about you getting perfect score AL4 (AL1 in every subject), but also, you are cute and pokable and squishy like the swollen red blood cell diagrams in Science Paper 2+AAoACgAA-em size +AD0A 2048+AAoACgAA-ascent +AD0A 2118+AAoA-descent +AD0A 1059+AAoACgAA-x height +AD0A 1059+AAoA-ascender +AD0A 1649+AAoA-descender +AD0A 706+AAoACgAA-stroke weight +AD0A 200+AAoACgAA-heart dimensions +AD0A 444 x 400+AAoA-heart equation +AD0A parametric, x +AD0A 16sin^3t, y +AD0A ...+AAoACgAA-designed by InfinityIntegral.sg, index number 05524F in PSLE 2021+AAoACgAA-this is version 3 of the font, a version 4 is expected some time possibly much later+AAoACgAK-preview text (ASCII):+AAoA-Welcome to Singapore, my homeland. Our country spans a vast 744.3 square kilometers, an increase of $5^2 +- 8 - 5 +AD0A 28+AFwAXAAA%$ since the 1960s when everything began. Vibrant New Towns stretch across the Heartlands (as opposed to the Downtown zone), from Queenstown and Boon Lay (official name: +ACIA-Jurong West+ACIA) in the West to Pasir Ris / Changi in the East. You can visit places like Xishan [Yishun], Zhenghua {Bkt Gombak}, and Kallang <near Aljunied? I think>. Further North, on the Malaysian border*, there is Woodlands & Sembawang. You`ll,+AH4A that typo; You'll never get bored exploring the #1 country in the Universe!+AAoA-This is definitely not the most complete or the most well formatted travel guide on the Internet (see @visit_singapore | VisitSingapore on Instagram for where actually to go), but it contains all the letters of ASCII and is great for testing if your font renders properly.+AAoACgAK-preview text (multi script):+AAoA----------- Singapore ----------+AAoA[EL] We, members of our shared Singaporean family, must uphold the highest possible standards in everything we do to achieve progress for our nation and to act as role models for the rest of the world.+AAoA[CL] +YhFO7E9cTjplsFKgV2FZJ1u2Xq12hGIQVFj/DF/FmHtXKGJ